      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] 3D CG, cinematic, a wide shot holds on a pitch-black volumetric void above a polished obsidian floor. Thin cyan-white light streaks tear in from the left and right edges of frame, cross at the center, and break apart into drifting brushed-chrome fragments that hover in a loose cloud. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at fast speed while the fragments rotate, catch a hard rim light, and snap together into individual letterforms with glowing orange molten seams along their inner edges.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.000, the shot cuts to a low-angle medium shot taken just above the floor as the letters slam into final alignment and lock, spelling \"Generate Movie\" across the center of frame in a wide sans-serif face. A ring of orange sparks bursts from the impact point, a circular shockwave of fine dust ripples outward across the obsidian floor, and the molten seams cool from orange to deep blue. The camera pulls out with small amplitude at slow speed while a horizontal anamorphic lens flare sweeps left to right along the polished metal faces and a thin cyan line draws beneath the words from left to right. The title holds centered and motionless as the last sparks fall out of frame.\n\noverall_soundscape: Two rising air-tearing whooshes travel from the edges of the stereo field toward the center over a low sub-bass rumble. Small metal fragments click and grind as they rotate into place, followed by a heavy metal-on-metal slam, a brief spark crackle, and a wide reverb tail that decays into near silence.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A synth riser climbing in pitch and volume over a fast pulsing low-end throb, cut off by a single distorted brass-and-drum hit at the moment of impact, then a sustained low drone that fades out.",
